Z||000000||gargoyle||09-16-2001||08:12 PM||||I'm starting to reassemble my interior from the stereo install. I went to put a new console support in and I discovered I'm missing a few things.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> There is a bracket just forward of the shifter that this piece bolts too but I don't know what goes on the bracket. I guess they are clips of some sort but I don't have a clue. Can somebody out there enlighten me and also where can I get some of whatever they are. Thanks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||5
