Z||000002||Indiana_resto_guy||09-16-2001||09:06 PM||||I think I know what your talking about.<BR>You have a different plastic support the runs the length of the tunnel. Correct?<BR>Now you have a metal bracket the goes from the left to the right in front of the shifter. Right?<BR>You know that it bolts down in front of shifter and you are wondering how the support is attached to this piece. OK so far?<BR>There are 2 small clips that are evidently missing from this piece because you can't attach it to the support. Yes?<BR>You might try a HELP section of you parts store for them. They are for small screws with medium size washers, the same size screw that the rest of it is assembled with.||||reg||1
Z||000003||gargoyle||09-16-2001||09:11 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Thanks Indiana_resto_guy. I thought that was what they were but I wasn't sure.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
